'''Ultra Form''' is the fourth form of certain [[:Category:Cat Units|Cat Units]], first introduced in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]]. They are an additional upgrade to cats who already have [[True Form]]s, further improving their stats and/or [[Special Abilities|abilities]]. All [[Talents]] can still be unlocked, upgraded and take effect when a unit is in its Ultra Form. Unlike with regular Talents, unlocking an Ultra Form does not grant access to Ultra Talents.

This evolution stage is currently exclusive to [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cats]], which can attain their Ultra Forms at level 60 using [[Catfruit]], Behemoth Stones and XP.

==Changes in Ultra Form==
Below are all possible Ultra Form upgrades in the game (up to [[Version 15.7 Update|Version 15.7]]):

===[[THE DYNAMITES (Gacha Event)|THE DYNAMITES]]===
*[[Baby Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Baby Cat]]: Increases movement speed, [[Knockback]] chance and [[Wave Attack]] level. Gains [[Omni Strike]].
*[[Cat Clan Heroes (Uber Rare Cat)|Cat Clan Heroes]]: Increases health and piercing range and decreases time between attacks and backswing. Gains chance to cause an [[Explosion]] (100%) and [[Immune to Waves|Wave Immunity]].

===[[Sengoku Wargods Vajiras (Gacha Event)|Sengoku Wargods Vajiras]]===
*[[Oda Nobunaga (Uber Rare Cat)|Oda Nobunaga]]: Increases health and knockback count. Gains [[:Category:Aku Enemies|Aku]] target and [[Counter-Surge]].
*[[Uesugi Kenshin (Uber Rare Cat)|Uesugi Kenshin]]: Increases health and range. Decreases recharge time. Gains chance to fire level 4 [[Wave Attack#Mini-Wave|Mini-Waves]] (100%).
*[[Narita Kaihime (Uber Rare Cat)|Narita Kaihime]]: Increases health, range, speed and [[Savage Blow]] chance (30%). Gains chance to cause an Explosion (50%) and [[Sage Slayer]].

===[[Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS (Gacha Event)|Lords of Destruction DRAGON EMPERORS]]===
*[[Dioramos (Uber Rare Cat)|Dioramos]]: Increases health, damage, range and time between attacks and decreases backswing. Gains [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] target, [[Multi-Hit]] and [[Long Distance]].

===[[Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals (Gacha Event)|Cyber Academy Galaxy Gals]]===
*[[Windy (Uber Rare Cat)|Windy]]: Increases range, speed and backswing and decreases time between attacks and foreswing. Replaces [[Massive Damage]] with [[Insane Damage]].
*[[Thundia (Uber Rare Cat)|Thundia]]: Increases health, damage, range, speed and time between attacks, and decreases recharge time. Gains 100% [[Survive]], immunity to [[Immune to Slow|Slow]] and [[Immune to Weaken|Weaken]], and [[Multi-Hit]] and Long Distance.

===[[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS]]===
*[[Princess Kaguya (Uber Rare Cat)|Princess Kaguya]]: Reverts to Normal Form's stats and abilities. Compared to Normal Form, increases health and gains [[Metal Killer]].
*[[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|The Grateful Crane]]: Gains Omni Strike, guaranteed Lv.10 Wave Attack and Sage Slayer and increased health on top of a reduced cost.
*[[Kasa Jizo (Uber Rare Cat)|Kasa Jizo]]: Reverts to Normal Form's stats and abilities. Compared to Normal Form, increases health, speed and backswing. Gains [[Survive]] and [[Omni Strike]].

===[[Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes (Gacha Event)|Justice Strikes Back! Dark Heroes]]===
*[[Catman (Uber Rare Cat)|Catman]]: Increases health. Decreases time between attacks and recharge time. Gains [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] target and [[Immune to Drain|Drain Immunity]].
*[[The White Rabbit (Uber Rare Cat)|The White Rabbit]]: Increases health, attack and range. Decreases time between attacks. Gains chance to slow (100%), [[Strong Against]], Sage Slayer, Multi-Hit and Long Distance. Removes Knockback ability.
*[[Detective Vigler (Uber Rare Cat)|Detective Vigler]]: Decreased attack foreswing and time between attacks, Increases health, speed, wave level and backswing and grants Sage Slayer and Wave Immunity.

===[[Frontline Assault IRON LEGION (Gacha Event)|Frontline Assault IRON LEGION]]===
*[[Mighty Kat-A-Pult (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Kat-A-Pult]]: Increases health, damage, chance to weaken (100%), and inner range. Gains [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] target, [[Immune to Curse]] and [[Immune to Toxic]].
*[[Mighty Drednot (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Drednot]]: Increases health and range. Decreases time between attacks, foreswing and recharge time. Gains [[Immune to Knockback]].
*[[Mighty Bomburr (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Bomburr]]: Increases health, gains Omni Strike, Sage Slayer, 50% chance to fire an Explosion and [[Immune to Explosions|Immunity to Explosions]].
*[[Mighty Thermae D-Lux (Uber Rare Cat)|Mighty Thermae D-Lux]]: Increases health, damage, Omni Strike range and [[Freeze]] duration. Gains [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]] target and [[Immune to Toxic]].

===[[Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES (Gacha Event)|Nature's Guardians ELEMENTAL PIXIES]]===
*[[Aer (Uber Rare Cat)|Aer]]: Increases health, range and piercing range. Gains chance to knockback (100%).
*[[Bora (Uber Rare Cat)|Bora]]: Increases health, damage, range, speed, slightly increases backswing and gives the ability to [[Weaken]] enemies (100% chance, 50% cut to damage).
*[[Mizli (Uber Rare Cat)|Mizli]]: Increases health, damage, range, has its Resist ability replaced with [[Insanely Tough]]. Gains a [[Surge Attacks|Mini-Surge]] (100%, Level 2) and [[Sage Slayer]].
*[[Voli (Uber Rare Cat)|Voli]]: Increases health, damage, decreases time between attacks, gains [[Multi-Hit]], [[Long Distance]], and [[Immune to Drain]].

===[[METAL BUSTERS (Gacha Event)|METAL BUSTERS]]===
*[[Sakura Sonic (Uber Rare Cat)|Sakura Sonic]]: Increases health, damage, [[Critical Hit]] chance (8%), as well as Slow and Weaken uptime. Gains Omni Strike and a new combo.

